//XMITSEND JOB (ACCT),'XMIT SEND',CLASS=A,MSGCLASS=H,
//             NOTIFY=&SYSUID
//* Build an XMIT without sending it across NJE.
//* Set NODE, USER, the source data set, and the output XMIT.
//TRANSMIT EXEC PGM=IKJEFT01,DYNAMNBR=50
//SYSTSPRT DD SYSOUT=*
//SYSTSIN  DD *
  TRANSMIT NODE01.IBMUSER -
    DATASET('IBMUSER.SOURCE.PDS') -
    MEMBERS(MEM1,MEM2) -
    OUTDATASET('IBMUSER.SOURCE.XMIT') -
    NOLOG NONOTIFY
/*
//* Omit MEMBERS to transmit every member.
//* Add SEQ or PDS after the data set when TRANSMIT should
//* not decide the organization itself.
